{"id":"tro_ne","lemma":"trône","pos":"noun","rank":2681,"glosses":["throne (royal seat)","throne (lavatory)"],"ipa":"/tʁon/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-tr%C3%B4ne.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-tr%C3%B4ne.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trônes"},"examples":[{"text":"Il succèdera au trône.","en":"He will succeed to the throne.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Le prince accéda au trône.","en":"The prince succeeded to the throne.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"prince"},{"g":"to reach","l":"accéder"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Le trône du roi était en or massif.","en":"The king's throne was made out of solid gold.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"massive"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"golden"]]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas la foire du Trône.","en":"This is not Disneyland.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a fair, an exposition"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Le Dauphin est celui qui succède au trône.","en":"The crown prince is the one who is to succeed to the throne.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"dolphin"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the one"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to succeed","l":"succéder"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}